WEBVTT

00:03:27.286 --> 00:03:32.250
quyosh panellari yoki potensial yoki yadro
tizimlari tomonidan ta’minlanishi mumkin.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.503
Amaldagi dizaynlarga ko’ra,
bu taxminan 8 kun davom etadi

00:03:35.503 --> 00:03:39.048
ob’ektni
geostatsionar orbitaga ko’tarish .

00:03:39.298 --> 00:03:41.467
Va to’g’ri radiatsiya himoyasi bilan,

00:03:41.467 --> 00:03:44.387
odamlar nazariy jihatdan
ham haydashlari mumkin edi.

00:03:44.762 --> 00:03:47.848
Xo’sh,bu ulkan inshootni qurishimizga
nima to’sqinlik qilmoqda ?

00:03:47.848 --> 00:03:51.811
Birinchidan, qurilishdagi baxtsiz hodisa
halokatli bo’lishi mumkin.

00:03:51.811 --> 00:03:55.398
Ammo asosiy muammo
kabelning o’zida.

00:03:55.523 --> 00:03:58.276
Katta miqdordagi vaznni qollash tashqari ,

00:03:58.276 --> 00:04:01.112
kabelning materiali
etarlicha mustahkam bo’lishi kerak